<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 map sizes for quick, medium or long campaigns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your ruler between 21 available kings of the 7 playable factions, each one with its own technology and unit tree.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT TACTICAL BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your units, take advantage of your strengths and defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/735dcfaaabd4d6bdbbcc7ee7359203b3.poster.avif?t=1766324627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/735dcfaaabd4d6bdbbcc7ee7359203b3.webm?t=1766324627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/735dcfaaabd4d6bdbbcc7ee7359203b3.mp4?t=1766324627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK POWERFUL UNITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and upgrade to better units to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/b02a02eee05efddea56a8bb29a2acdfa.poster.avif?t=1766324627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/b02a02eee05efddea56a8bb29a2acdfa.webm?t=1766324627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/b02a02eee05efddea56a8bb29a2acdfa.mp4?t=1766324627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND COLONIZE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map and colonize new settlements for your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/c40c9aab12d85f547e12518a9fc2716e.poster.avif?t=1766324627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/c40c9aab12d85f547e12518a9fc2716e.webm?t=1766324627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/c40c9aab12d85f547e12518a9fc2716e.mp4?t=1766324627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create buildings to produce more resources and upgrade your cities to allocate more buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/55360cf8d0ef80f9c0a0ba716a361f7d.poster.avif?t=1766324627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/55360cf8d0ef80f9c0a0ba716a361f7d.webm?t=1766324627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/55360cf8d0ef80f9c0a0ba716a361f7d.mp4?t=1766324627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemies in battle and conquer their settlements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525240/extras/4036b81e9a4e52985995d5c5f6ddf065.poster.avif?t=1766324627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source